      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Isotope capillary permeability and electroneuromyography were employed to study potency of peloidin vacuum-phonophoresis and its combination with pelobalneotherapy for lumbar osteochondrosis (LO). Altogether 108 patients with LO neurological syndromes were treated. Peloidin vacuum-phonophoresis proved a pathogenetic treatment of the condition valuable at all stages of LO patients rehabilitation."},
